<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Foster Wheeler cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Foster Wheeler cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said Monday it had cut Foster Wheeler Corp to market perform from its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the engineering and environmental services company were off 4/16 to 42-15/16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
